NanaType licensing (Steam edition)
==================================

Original NanaType code is licensed under the MIT License; see LICENSE-MIT.
Copyright (c) 2026 Sena.

The Steam edition is built without the Bilibili web, Douyin and YouTube chat
sources (the `unofficial-chat` feature), so it contains neither the
CC-BY-NC-4.0 Bilibili protocol material nor the Douyin signing code that
the GitHub release carries. It links the Steamworks SDK's redistributable
steam_api library, distributed under the Steamworks SDK Access Agreement.

Other dependencies, fonts and artwork retain their respective licences.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for sources, scope and licence-file locations.
